{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】深水埗元州街一幢唐樓凌晨有雜物起火，無人受傷。</p><p>火警救熄後，消防員在現場調查。凌晨近3時，元州街68至70號一幢唐樓梯間有雜物起火，消防員接報到場，迅速將火救熄。事件中無人受傷，毋須疏散，起火原因有待調查。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:53.936870+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T23:41:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T08:38:05.925021+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:44.444915+00:00","content_hash":"cc1ba1cf78733b615cb2d5a9297425d594ed51a48277b4ef84199c45bf343ad4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}